CDir <CLFiler$ChoicesDir>
IfThere <CLFiler$ChoicesDir>.log-prev Then Delete <CLFiler$ChoicesDir>.log-prev
IfThere <CLFiler$ChoicesDir>.log Then Rename <CLFiler$ChoicesDir>.log <CLFiler$ChoicesDir>.log-prev

wimpslot -min 10000K -max 128000K
| add option -dir <dir> to initially open specified directory
| add option -open to open the window at startup
| add option -toolbars to open new windows with some toolbars or three view switched off, 3 - all on, 2 - treeview off, 1 - treeview & status bar off, 0 - all off
| add option -no-search-drives to turn off completely the drives (filesystems) detection. In this case you should put all your FS in the "<Choices$Write>.CLFiler.predefined-roots" file. Every FS on the new line, empty lines ignored.
| add option -debug to turn on the debug logging. In case of problems please add -debug and send the logs to us
| Example: <CLFiler$Dir>.!RunImage -debug -open -dir HostFS::HostFS.$.1 1><CLFiler$ChoicesDir>.std-log 2><CLFiler$ChoicesDir>.error-log
| <CLFiler$Dir>.!RunImage -debug 1><CLFiler$ChoicesDir>.std-log 2><CLFiler$ChoicesDir>.error-log
